Derived work: SystemEQ for Mac
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Parts of Timbre are adapted from SystemEQ for Mac by denzam and contributors,
https://github.com/denzam/SystemEQ-for-Mac (version 1.4.4), licensed under the
GNU General Public License v3. Copyright in that code remains with its authors.

The following Timbre files contain code adapted from SystemEQ for Mac. They
were modified for Timbre in October 2026:

  Sources/Audio/SystemAudioEngine.swift
      Process-tap + private aggregate device setup, IOProc and stereo render
      path (from Audio/ProcessTapEngine.swift). Modified: rewritten around a
      lock-free DSP core; output/sample-rate/wake handling; watchdog and
      give-up safety net; single tap-stream finder.

  Sources/Audio/CoreAudioHelpers.swift
      Core Audio property helpers (from Audio/ProcessTapEngine.swift).
      Modified: generalised into typed helpers; process list for detection.

  Sources/DSP/Biquad.swift
      Biquad coefficient designs (RBJ Audio EQ Cookbook) and the output safety
      limiter (from Audio/BiquadFilterVDSP.swift). Modified: double precision,
      non-finite and range guards, response/headroom maths at the device rate.

  Sources/DSP/DSPCore.swift
      vDSP_biquad cascade setup (from Audio/BiquadFilterVDSP.swift). Modified:
      immutable filter chains handed to the audio thread lock-free, state
      inheritance and crossfades, A/B bypass ramp, analyser ring buffer.

All other files were written for Timbre.

